Third-party components and data

This license applies to the source code of the ReTKY2JGD plugin only.

1. TKY2JGD.gsb
   The coordinate transformation grid file TKY2JGD.gsb is NOT included in this
   package and is NOT covered by this license. It is published by the
   Geospatial Information Authority of Japan (GSI) under the GSI content usage
   terms. Obtain it directly from GSI and comply with those terms.
   https://www.gsi.go.jp/sokuchikijun/sokuchikijun41012.html#zahyo
   https://www.gsi.go.jp/kikakuchousei/kikakuchousei40182.html

2. Data under data/reference/
   Reference materials derived from the Forestry Agency of Japan's "National
   Forest GIS data (published March 2025)", distributed through the G-Spatial
   Information Center, are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
   International (CC BY 4.0).
   Original data: Forestry Agency of Japan
   https://www.geospatial.jp/ckan/dataset/a45
   Adaptation: the ReTKY2JGD project
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
